At document starts, several person labels fire on the label itself instead.
A few English cue words have a small negative background bias. Matching is
literal, including roots inside names and code; no sense disambiguation is done.
The previous token is the only state, reset at document boundaries. This omits
most weak, vocabulary-specific background activity.
