The component is strongly negative on whole tokens 'abs', 'absolute', 'absolutely' (in
prose, in code such as `.abs` or `_absolute`, and their Chinese/Russian forms), less on
'absence' / 'absent', less again on 'absorb...', on the 'bs' fragment of 'abs' (as in
'OBSERVATION' split into 'O' + 'BS'), and on 'almost' (几乎, почти). Other tokens: zero.
